fn foldAndOrOfICmpsWithConstEq(PredL: CmpPredicate, LHS0: *mut Value, LHS1: *mut Value, LHS: *mut Value, PredR: CmpPredicate, RHS0: *mut Value, RHS1: *mut Value, RHSOneUse: bool, IsAnd: bool, IsLogical: bool, Builder: *mut BuilderTy, Q: *SimplifyQuery, I: *mut Instruction) -> *mut Value {
    if !isa(LHS1) || !isGuaranteedNotToBeUndefOrPoison(LHS1, null, null, null, 0) || isa(LHS0) {
        return null;
    }
    if (IsAnd && PredL != ICMP_EQ) || (!IsAnd && PredL != ICMP_NE) {
        return null;
